    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>You can now create&nbsp;Azure Synapse Runtime for Apache Spark 3.3.&nbsp;The essential changes include features which come from upgrading Apache Spark to version 3.3.1,&nbsp;and upgrading Delta Lake.&nbsp;Please review the official&nbsp;<a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2f%2fspark.apache.org%2freleases%2fspark-release-3-3-0.html&amp;data=05%7c01%7cv-teoshea%40microsoft.com%7cb441594600494fbc86ba08dad8a00779%7c72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7c1%7c0%7c638060479145054625%7cUnknown%7cTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7c3000%7c%7c%7c&amp;sdata=FQ3YVgQQhfO3POe3ItzZ%2fDpxpBbaMR%2BcLv6gvUfpND0%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">release notes for Apache Spark 3.3.0&nbsp;</a>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2f%2fspark.apache.org%2freleases%2fspark-release-3-3-1.html&amp;data=05%7c01%7cv-teoshea%40microsoft.com%7cb441594600494fbc86ba08dad8a00779%7c72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7c1%7c0%7c638060479145054625%7cUnknown%7cTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7c3000%7c%7c%7c&amp;sdata=pNRr9%2B3%2BSyKOEbaJoYphvsVuP3uffznmemM99Gpqhh0%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Apache Spark 3.3.1</a>&nbsp;to check the complete list of fixes and features. In addition, review the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2f%2fspark.apache.org%2fdocs%2flatest%2fsql-migration-guide.html%23upgrading-from-spark-sql-32-to-33&amp;data=05%7c01%7cv-teoshea%40microsoft.com%7cb441594600494fbc86ba08dad8a00779%7c72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7c1%7c0%7c638060479145054625%7cUnknown%7cTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7c3000%7c%7c%7c&amp;sdata=GTH%2Bjru%2fLUTMZTPWHkf8rUrpcu1b82izxfboTuo4NfI%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">migration guidelines between Spark 3.2 and 3.3</a>&nbsp;to assess potential changes to your applications, jobs and notebooks.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For additional details&nbsp;check&nbsp;<a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2f%2flearn.microsoft.com%2fen-us%2fazure%2fsynapse-analytics%2fspark%2fapache-spark-33-runtime&amp;data=05%7c01%7cv-teoshea%40microsoft.com%7cb441594600494fbc86ba08dad8a00779%7c72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7c1%7c0%7c638060479145054625%7cUnknown%7cTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7c3000%7c%7c%7c&amp;sdata=vQnWXt57Ppwxt4s3Ns%2fVsAcgovK4PqQBc9OdJ0mu68w%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Azure Synapse Runtime for Apache Spark 3.3&nbsp;components version.</a>&nbsp;</p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "You can now create Azure Synapse Runtime for Apache Spark 3.3. The essential changes include features which come from upgrading Apache Spark to version 3.3.1, and upgrading Delta Lake. Please review the official release notes for Apache Spark 3.3.0 and Apache Spark 3.3.1 to check the complete list of fixes and features. In addition, review the migration guidelines between Spark 3.2 and 3.3 to assess potential changes to your applications, jobs and notebooks.\n\nFor additional details check Azure Synapse Runtime for Apache Spark 3.3 components version."
